                                "sense_id": "5dac33ab-338b-31d2-bd66-1dcf01574560",
                                "text": "At Paris, just after dark one gusty evening in the autumn of 18—, I was enjoying the twofold luxury of meditation and a meerschaum, in company with my friend C. Auguste Dupin, […]",
